":[]},{"h":"Efficiency: 75+%","c":[]},{"h":"Switching Frequency: 50 kHz","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Description","active":true,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <h2>PoE Injector BN060-P12024 (24V, 0.5A - 12W) | Reliable Power for IP Cameras &amp; Access Points</h2><p>The PoE Injector BN060-P12024 is an efficient and compact Power over Ethernet (PoE) solution designed to power IP cameras, access points, and other PoE-enabled network devices using a single Ethernet cable. With an output of 24V DC at 0.5A (12W), it is perfect for powering devices in small to medium-sized network installations. This passive PoE injector supports 10/100Mbps data rates, ensuring smooth data transfer along with reliable power delivery.</p><h3>Key Features:</h3><ul><li>24V DC Output: Delivers stable 24V DC at 0.5A (12W) for powering IP cameras, access points, and other PoE devices.</li><li>Passive PoE Technology: Provides both power and data over a single Ethernet cable, reducing wiring complexity.</li><li>Compact Design: Small and lightweight, making it ideal for indoor installations in tight spaces.</li><li>Supports 10/100Mbps: Compatible with devices requiring standard Ethernet speeds, ensuring reliable data transmission.</li><li>Wide Device Compatibility: Works seamlessly with IP cameras, wireless access points, and VoIP phones that support passive PoE.</li><li>Energy Efficient: With a 12W output, this injector ensures energy-saving performance without compromising on power delivery.</li><li>Easy Setup: Plug-and-play installation for quick deployment in home or office networks.</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Ubiquiti UniFi U-POE-af 48V 0.32A (15W) PoE Adapter","href":"/ubiquiti-unifi-u-poe-af-48v-032a-15w-poe-adapter","now":"2,500৳","old":"2,800৳","single":""},{"name":"Ubiquiti UniFi